1
00:00:00,583 --> 00:00:02,463
(Howard:)What if they're women?

2
00:00:03,377 --> 00:00:06,007
(Penny:)Stare at them
and make them feel uncomfortable.

3
00:00:11,552 --> 00:00:13,472
[GUNSHOTS ON TV]

4
00:00:13,638 --> 00:00:15,058
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

5
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:18,600
- Hey.
- Hey.

6
00:00:18,976 --> 00:00:21,146
- How's it going?
- Fine.

7
00:00:21,854 --> 00:00:27,444
So listen, the Nuart is showing the revised,
definitive cut of Blade Runner.

8
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:28,860
- Seen it.
- No.

9
00:00:29,028 --> 00:00:31,738
(Howard:)You've seen
the 25th Anniversary Final Cut.

10
00:00:31,906 --> 00:00:35,196
(Howard:)This one has eight seconds
of previously-unseen footage.

11
00:00:35,368 --> 00:00:38,038
(Howard:)They say it completely changes
the tone of the film.

12
00:00:38,788 --> 00:00:40,208
(Leonard:)Pass.

13
00:00:40,373 --> 00:00:44,923
Come on. Afterwards, there's a Q&A
with Harrison Ford's body double.

14
00:00:45,086 --> 00:00:47,466
Look, I am in the "Halo" battle
of my life here.

15
00:00:47,630 --> 00:00:50,220
(Leonard:)There's this kid in Copenhagen,
he has no immune system.

16
00:00:50,383 --> 00:00:53,473
(Leonard:)So all he does is sit in his bubble
and play "Halo" 24/7.

17
00:00:54,136 --> 00:00:55,886
(Howard:)Can't you play him some other time?

18
00:00:56,055 --> 00:01:01,025
(Leonard:)Not if you believe his doctors.

